      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788675417706,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now lets try to break, these steps one by one:\n\n1 User access websites through domain names, such as nishantthapa.dev. Usually the Domain Name System(DNS) is a paid\nservice provided by the 3rd parties and it is not hosted in our server\n2. Internet protocol(IP) address is returned to the browser or mobile app. \n3. Once the IP address (of server) is obtained, Hypertext Transfer Protocol(HTTP) request are send directly to your web\nserver.\n4. The Web Server returns HTML pages or JSON response for rendering",
      "fontSize": 45,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now lets try to break, these steps one by one:\n\n1 User access websites through domain names, such as nishantthapa.dev. Usually the Domain Name System(DNS) is a paid\nservice provided by the 3rd parties and it is not hosted in our server\n2. Internet protocol(IP) address is returned to the browser or mobile app. \n3. Once the IP address (of server) is obtained, Hypertext Transfer Protocol(HTTP) request are send directly to your web\nserver.\n4. The Web Server returns HTML pages or JSON response for rendering",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
